# core v3.5 — the invariant the ORIGIN axis exists for.
#
# ONE synthetic health system, exporting twice. The first record came out of its
# FHIR endpoint, whose registrable domain is meridianhealth.example. The second
# came out of a C-CDA document of the same system, whose custodian organization
# is named "Meridian Health System". Nothing about either document is wrong, and
# the two derivation rules do not meet:
#
#   - the LABEL axis (clinical:sourceEHR) differs, because each transport worded
#     the organization the way its own document worded it. That is allowed: the
#     label is a display value and its semantics are unchanged;
#   - the INGESTION axis (cascade:sourceSystem) differs, because the patient
#     downloaded the two exports separately;
#   - the ORIGIN axis (cascade:sourceIdentity) is IDENTICAL, because the slug
#     normalization reduces both "meridianhealth.example" and "Meridian Health
#     System" to the same leading distinctive token.
#
# That last line is the whole fixture. A consumer grouping by ORIGIN sees one
# health system; a consumer grouping by either of the other two axes sees two.
#
# Fully synthetic: invented organization, invented endpoint, invented values.

@prefix cascade: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/core/v1#> .
@prefix clinical: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/clinical/v1#> .
@prefix health: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/health/v1#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Half one: through the system's FHIR endpoint.
<urn:uuid:5c1de001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a> a health:LabResultRecord ;
    health:testName "Hemoglobin A1c" ;
    health:resultValue "7.4" ;
    health:resultUnit "%" ;
    health:performedDate "2031-02-11"^^xsd:date ;
    cascade:dataProvenance cascade:ClinicalGenerated ;
    cascade:schemaVersion "1.3" ;
    cascade:sourceIdentity "org:meridian" ;
    clinical:sourceEHR "meridianhealth.example" ;
    cascade:sourceSystem "meridian-fhir-export" .

# Half two: through a C-CDA document of the SAME system.
<urn:uuid:5c1de001-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b> a health:LabResultRecord ;
    health:testName "Hemoglobin A1c" ;
    health:resultValue "7.4" ;
    health:resultUnit "%" ;
    health:performedDate "2031-02-11"^^xsd:date ;
    cascade:dataProvenance cascade:ClinicalGenerated ;
    cascade:schemaVersion "1.3" ;
    cascade:sourceIdentity "org:meridian" ;
    clinical:sourceEHR "Meridian Health System" ;
    cascade:sourceSystem "meridian-ccda-summary" .
